    'Reheat kofta in a skillet or microwave; keep lettuce cold.', 'Shape kofta up to 24 hours ahead and refrigerate covered.', 'Cut kofta into small strips and offer tzatziki as a dip.',
    'Build lettuce plates first and use pita as an optional side.', 'reviewed', null,
    'Mammas Chef Original / Mammas Chef', 'Herbed Turkey Kofta Lettuce Plates
